abstract: >-
  Code, frozen partitions, campaign records and preserved predictions for a
  full factorial evaluation of 15 colour sets (subsets of RGB, LAB, YCrCb and
  HSV) across 15 pre-trained backbones and two public neonatal jaundice
  datasets (NJN and NeoJaundice), with the analysis that reproduces the
  reported statistics. Code is released under the MIT licence and the derived
  records under CC BY 4.0; the source images are not redistributed.
